OL,3,GNEWSAInquiry hears 600-home scheme
OL,4,A'unsustainable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor has told a public inquiry
OL,7,Fa housebuilder's rejected proposal to
OL,8,Fbuild 600 homes is "unsustainable".
OL,10,FIn March, Stockton Council's planning
OL,11,Fcommittee rejected Taylor Wimpey's
OL,12,F#133m plan for land east of
OL,13,FHoldenfields Farm on Green Lane, Yarm,
OL,14,Fbut the developers appealed against the
OL,15,Fdecision to the Planning Inspectorate.
OL,17,FConservative councillor Tony Riordan
OL,18,Fgave evidence to the inquiry stating
OL,19,Ftraffic problems were a concern and
OL,20,Fhighlighted limited capacity to provide
OL,21,Felectrical supply to the site.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
