OL,3,GNEWSAInquiry hears 600-home scheme
OL,4,A'unsustainable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the developers said
OL,7,Fthe harms caused by the plan "don't
OL,8,Fcome anywhere close" to outweighing the
OL,9,Fbenefits.
